{
  "_comment": "Maps each <name>_tint/_mask pair in this folder to its display name, draw layer (underlay = beneath fragments, overlay = above fragments and HUD annotations), blend mode (screen/multiply/alpha -- independent of layer, do not derive one from the other), default opacity (0.0-0.4), and spans_both_zones (reserved, unenforced -- Temporal Fields has no Zone A/B divider). opacity_default values marked 'brief' come straight from the original spec; others are a uniform 0.05 starting point for content types the brief didn't cover, meant to be tuned against real footage. blend_mode defaults to 'alpha' for any entry that omits it.",

